ions. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/run_differs.py:2-36, 66-73, 95-100, 135-193, 255-300, 339-365, 398-476, 515-563, 606-611` — Preserve differ order, shared enrichment, identity resolvers, and failure containment. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/runtime.py:1-30, 168-172, 311-319, 344-360, 404-415` — Preserve immutable operation capture and backend/runtime composition. Consumer: none found.\n- `src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler/snapshot_lagfree_refresh.py:2-40, 100-108` — Preserve primary-store refresh and completeness/error behavior. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make test`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","id":"067e-02c4-6a6b-431b","parent_id":"d6eb-1c6c-88c3-48f6","priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in src/rebar/_engine/rebar_reconciler — cohort 04: mutation_payloads–snapshot_lagfree_refresh"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1788570752850213905,"uuid":"03605d56-b7d2-4199-9cae-763467017c36"}